<textbox name="info_txt" layers="0" z-value="0" width="624.813" font-size="12">
	<position x="80" y="100"/>
	<comment> <![CDATA[[ 3DCityDB Project ]

The award winning 3D City Database is a free geo database to store, represent, and manage virtual 3D city models on top of a standard spatial relational database. The database schema implements the CityGML standard with semantically rich and multi-scale urban objects facilitating complex analysis tasks, far beyond visualization.

Site: http://www.3dcitydb.org
Created by: Felix Kunde]]> </comment>
</textbox>

